      }
    },
    "Targeted adjustment: drag on the image to change that color's saturation, or its hue with Command held": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标调整：在图像上拖动可更改该颜色的饱和度，按住 Command 键拖动则更改其色相"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text color": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text fields keep standard macOS editing keys. Dialogs share the Apply/Cancel assignments above. Numeric fields use Up/Down, with Shift for larger steps. Standard macOS commands include ⌘Q to quit and ⌃⌘F for full screen. The shortcut editor itself always uses Return to save and Esc to cancel when not recording.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本框保留标准的 macOS 编辑快捷键。对话框共用上方的“应用/取消”设置。数字框使用上/下方向键，按住 Shift 键可加大步长。标准 macOS 命令包括 ⌘Q 退出和 ⌃⌘F 全屏。未录制时，快捷键编辑器本身始终用回车键存储、Esc 键取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The brush trails the pointer on a string this long, so a shaky hand still draws a smooth line": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画笔像被绳子拖着跟随指针，这个长度越大，手抖时画出的线条也越平滑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The characters to draw with, in any order: each spot gets the one whose ink best matches its tone": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用于绘制的字符，顺序不限：每个位置会选用墨量与其色调最接近的字符"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The height of each line of characters": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每行字符的高度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
